Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.87,0:00:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU! YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.21,0:00:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Your moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.21,0:01:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, we're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.95,0:01:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I guess it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.63,0:01:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The tablet returned us all to the present.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.23,0:01:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.79,0:01:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you worried about the Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.83,0:01:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, a temp?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.03,0:01:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you don't think he's still\Nstuck in the ancient past, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.57,0:01:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, are you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.63,0:01:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm right where i belong with us you\Ndid it we all did it together and now
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.21,0:01:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,the darkness unleashed by the shadow\Ngame so long ago is finally over it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.39,0:01:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,only took you five thousand years and\Ni'm glad i was here to help me too
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.27,0:01:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,i mean a guy can get pretty used to\Nthis whole saving the world thing Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.69,0:01:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,remind me how getting possessed\Nby an evil spirit was helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.15,0:02:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no further comments at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.19,0:02:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Embarrassed because you nearly\Ndestroyed the world as we know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.35,0:02:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, like you've never gotten\Npossessed before, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.47,0:02:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really going to miss them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.63,0:02:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Farrah, uh, I mean, a town.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.51,0:02:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise one of these days I'll\Nget used to that name of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.23,0:02:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe after all these\Nyears you have your memory back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.03,0:02:21.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.05,0:02:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You've chained Yugi to an anchor and\Nthreatened to take over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.75,0:02:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ringing any bells?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.81,0:02:28.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no further comments at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.61,0:02:30.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, tell Joey he was possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.59,0:02:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.81,0:02:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you'll be needing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.39,0:02:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The Millennium Eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.89,0:02:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,And where did you get your\Nhands on that, rich boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.01,0:02:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.92,0:02:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't just chuck a Millennium\Nitem at someone and walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.73,0:02:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sick of your silent\Ntreatment routines.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.25,0:03:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.16,0:03:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.91,0:03:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.83,0:03:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.33,0:03:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a hunch this is the good Bacora.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.61,0:03:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.69,0:03:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The last thing I remember was\Nhearing a strange voice and then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.65,0:03:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, take it easy, pal. What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.63,0:03:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I need some food.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.87,0:03:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.99,0:03:26.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't see me passing out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.51,0:03:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Joey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.42,0:03:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, we could all use a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.95,0:03:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It has been 5,000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.67,0:03:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's got something\Nthat belongs to you, Yook.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.19,0:03:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.35,0:03:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that Zork has vanished, so\Nhas the evil spirit of the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.35,0:03:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,So Bakura is finally free.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:50.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, a little help here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.09,0:03:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.05,0:03:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Grab a leg, will ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.63,0:04:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadi, please know that your items\Nwill finally be laid to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.81,0:04:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And thank you, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.53,0:04:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto, according to the\Ninscription on this tablet,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.97,0:04:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,you went on to be a great\Npharaoh in your own right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.69,0:04:23.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You kept my father's dream alive\Nby maintaining peace in Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.29,0:04:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And knowing this, my spirit can\Nfinally enter its resting place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.07,0:04:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.47,0:04:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you know, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.27,0:04:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,My pharaoh, were you able to\Nrecover your lost memories? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.89,0:04:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then after 5,000 years, our family's\Ntask is finally complete. You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.39,0:04:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And the seven Millennium items are\Ngathered together at last. My king.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.13,0:04:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.13,0:04:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I must seal them away forever\Nso I can enter the spirit world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.31,0:04:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're leaving us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.61,0:05:01.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the final task\Nof my mission, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.47,0:05:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I always knew. I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.43,0:05:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,you came back after all these years so you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.55,0:05:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,could regain your memories\Nand save the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.35,0:05:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that you've done\Nthat, you can finally rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.57,0:05:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, if you and your\Nfriends would like us to,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.57,0:05:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick and I can lead you to the final\Nresting place of the seven Millennium Items.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.15,0:05:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the Millennium Stone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.81,0:05:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And the inscription above this\Nancient stone reads as follows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:38.67,Default,,0,0,0,,To the spirit world thou may proceed,\Nbut first thou must complete this deed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.41,0:05:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Return the items whence they came,\Nand speak aloud the pharaoh's name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.01,0:05:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready for your final task? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.21,0:05:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Then allow me to be your guide\Nto the shrine of the next world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.13,0:06:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't we zip over to\Nthis shrine in a plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.31,0:06:15.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid this sanctuary can only\Nbe reached by boat. We don't want
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.63,0:06:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,to rush this This is the last trip\Nwe'll ever take with the pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.15,0:06:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,dude Since when are you so sappy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.19,0:06:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Boats rule! I love boats!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.99,0:06:29.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Who doesn't love boats?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.15,0:06:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.25,0:06:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Ages ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,it was believed that boats\Nwere the only vessels
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.57,0:06:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,able to transport spirits\Nto the world beyond.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.91,0:06:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The world beyond?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.49,0:06:44.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The ancient Egyptians believed that\Nthis spirit world existed in the west,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.03,0:06:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,where the sun sets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.15,0:06:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and so the pharaoh's court ordered this
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.79,0:06:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,sanctuary to be built on\Nan island west of egypt
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.57,0:06:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,ahoy there mateys all right\Nyou landlubbers climb aboard
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.77,0:07:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,no way where did you guys come\Nfrom about time you got here
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.73,0:07:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,hey
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.07,0:07:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,we've been bored out of\Nour minds waiting for
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.41,0:07:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,you guys to get here i\Ndidn't know you were coming
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.33,0:07:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, ever since you left for Egypt,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.27,0:07:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,there was this voice\Ninside my head saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.25,0:07:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you miss such a momentous event\Nin your grandson's life, you old fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.55,0:07:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And with Gramps hearing voices in his\Nhead, I thought I should come along, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.37,0:07:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Just to keep an eye on things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And when we got here, we ran\Ninto Mokuba at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.01,0:07:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you took off without telling anyone,\Nso Roland and I tracked you down. I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.23,0:07:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know I needed to report every\Nmove I make to my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.97,0:07:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you better not do it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.89,0:07:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,or I'll take over Kaiba Corp\Nand make you work for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.11,0:07:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.69,0:07:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really come all this\Nway just to keep Gramps company?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's not like anyone\Ninvited me, so I invited myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.45,0:08:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,After everything we've been through, it\Nwould have been nice to get a phone call.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.75,0:08:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Duke, but I had a lot going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Your grandfather filled me in on\Nthe flight over, so I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.11,0:08:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And while we were waiting\Nfor you to show up,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.85,0:08:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I took the liberty of explaining things\Nto everyone else you forgot to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.97,0:08:17.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You've finally done it, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.89,0:08:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything I spent my life creating\Nhas been leading up to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.03,0:08:25.29,Default,,0,0,0,,From the moment I received\Nthe Millennium Eye...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.37,0:08:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...to the moment I recreated the ancient\NShadow Games in the form of Duel Monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,it was fate's hand guiding me to set the\Nstage for the pharaoh's final journey home
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.43,0:08:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,but i wasn't the only\None led by fate every
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.39,0:08:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,person the pharaoh\Nencountered along the way was
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.87,0:08:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,destined to play a role\Nin his journey and i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.49,0:08:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,willing to bet most of\Nthem didn't even know it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.15,0:08:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But each individual,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.07,0:09:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how utterly clueless,\Nwas a necessary piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.55,0:09:06.55,Default,,0,0,0,,needed to complete the\Npuzzle of the pharaoh's life
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.21,0:09:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Be they weird fishermen duelists\NOr annoying mousy little girls
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.91,0:09:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All of these people have one thing\Nin common Each one is connected
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.95,0:09:25.23,Default,,0,0,0,,by a young man named Yugi Boy and\Nthat mysterious alter ego of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.15,0:09:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,And not only did these\Nindividuals help Yugi,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.71,0:09:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but in turn, Yugi touched\Neach of their lives as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.75,0:09:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I've said it a million times,\Nbut thanks for being there, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.79,0:09:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.39,0:09:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you still hanging\Naround for anyway, rich boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.49,0:09:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We have our reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.11,0:09:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What are our reasons again?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.39,0:09:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, why did you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.29,0:09:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Although he'd never admit it, Kaiba is\Nhere for the same reason we're all here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.39,0:10:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,To witness the Pharaoh's\Nfinal rite of passage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.13,0:10:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So he does believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.99,0:10:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yugi, before we go any further,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,there's something else you\Nshould know about all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.41,0:10:15.47,Default,,0,0,0,,There's another ancient passage\Ninscribed above the Millennium Stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.67,0:10:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It mentions a battle ritual.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.87,0:10:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you say battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.01,0:10:22.87,Default,,0,0,0,,In order for the Pharaoh\Nto enter the spirit world,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.95,0:10:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,he must first face off against a\Nworthy opponent in battle and lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.33,0:10:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of battle do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.45,0:10:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,In ancient times, this\Nreferred to a duel with swords.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.41,0:10:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But luckily for us, today we duel\None another with cards. A duel?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.67,0:10:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly, Yugi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.79,0:10:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I must lose in a game of duel monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.99,0:10:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't mean to be disrespectful,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.03,0:10:47.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Merrick, but I don't get what the\Nchallenge is in losing a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.37,0:10:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.31,0:10:51.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Winning is easy for the Pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.23,0:10:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but being able to accept\Ndefeat is probably
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.35,0:10:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,the greatest test of\Nhis character there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.01,0:10:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have a point there, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.23,0:11:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But where are we going to find a duelist\Nwho's good enough to beat the Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.77,0:11:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, this boat ride\Nreally takes me back, Uke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.47,0:11:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't it seem like just yesterday\Nwe were all on a boat like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.89,0:11:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,headed for Duelist Kingdom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.17,0:11:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.43,0:11:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to toot my own horn, but\NI've come a long way since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.33,0:11:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And if given the chance, I could\Nkick the pharaoh's ancient butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.91,0:11:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.82,0:11:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.13,0:11:34.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, so maybe I came\Non a little strong there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.89,0:11:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,A little strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:39.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I meant to say, I'd like\Na shot against the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.93,0:11:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too risky. You'll lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.37,0:11:43.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.28,0:11:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the support, but someone's\Ngot to beat the pharaohs, so why not me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.09,0:11:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you're a joke, Wheeler.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.55,0:11:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.97,0:11:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you losers realize I've been\Nwaiting for this moment for years?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I challenge you to the ultimate duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.05,0:11:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.65,0:12:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now wait a second here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.73,0:12:03.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in line first!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.71,0:12:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.43,0:12:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna make this brief.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.49,0:12:12.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe in all this ancient\NEgyptian nonsense, and I never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.35,0:12:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But I deserve a shot against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.21,0:12:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean the Pharaoh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.03,0:12:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It does make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.41,0:12:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.32,0:12:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,you guys have had a rivalry going on\Never since he showed up in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.05,0:12:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.77,0:12:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.87,0:12:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already made my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.91,0:12:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna duel the Pharaoh. You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.91,0:12:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.81,0:12:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you see, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.81,0:12:38.99,Default,,0,0,0,,This duel will be a test for me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.93,0:12:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I put this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.71,0:12:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't play a duel\Nagainst yourself, Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.27,0:12:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't plan to.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.21,0:12:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.43,0:12:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to stand here and watch you
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.45,0:12:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,give a title shot to\Nyour imaginary friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.09,0:12:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Drop him, rich boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.75,0:12:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, this is something\NI know I need to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.67,0:12:59.85,Default,,0,0,0,,And deep down, you know it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.91,0:13:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yug.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.51,0:13:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Mokuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.39,0:13:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.65,0:13:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind\Nof stunt you're pulling,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.25,0:13:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,but if you're going to be dueling, then\Nyou may as well build yourself a real deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.03,0:13:19.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that bargain basement deck you use.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.67,0:13:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's a pretty\Nimpressive collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.29,0:13:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't be needing it, Kaiba. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.51,0:13:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be sticking with my usual deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.75,0:13:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The Pharaoh and I built it together, so\Nit's only fitting that I use that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.11,0:13:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.02,0:13:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.21,0:13:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.65,0:13:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Seto! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.25,0:13:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Enjoy the cruise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.01,0:13:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.31,0:13:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Yugi. Have a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.87,0:13:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, Taya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.23,0:13:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,As the self-appointed cruise director, I\Nthought I'd tell you we arrived tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.77,0:13:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Cool. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.25,0:14:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess you're getting ready for your\Nbig duel against the Pharaoh, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.17,0:14:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.08,0:14:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sort of like my final gift to\Nhim before he leaves us forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.79,0:14:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.59,0:14:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I don't want to\Nsee him go, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:19.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither do I, but it's time\Nfor him to move on, Tata.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.05,0:14:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, if I win, that means I'm\Nready to separate from him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.71,0:14:27.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Yugi's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.41,0:14:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But it doesn't make this\Nany easier. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.65,0:14:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, everything's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.89,0:14:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I should really let you get\Nback to doing your thing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.57,0:14:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, so, great, then\NI'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.67,0:14:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night, Teya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.91,0:14:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh, I have a feeling she\Nwanted to say goodbye to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.81,0:14:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.21,0:14:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I know this is what's\Nbest for the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.35,0:14:58.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't belong in this world,\Nand now that he has his memory back,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.75,0:15:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,he can finally be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.79,0:15:05.39,Default,,0,0,0,,But secretly, I keep hoping Yugi's\Ngonna lose, so the Pharaoh has to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.45,0:15:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I solved the Millennium Puzzle,\NI was a completely different person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.97,0:15:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Timid, shy, lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.17,0:15:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But ever since that day, when the\NPharaoh and I joined together,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.09,0:15:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been strong and confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.85,0:15:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I win that duel tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.15,0:15:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll prove that I'm ready\Nto face the world on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.57,0:15:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All I have to do is remember everything\Nthe Pharaoh taught me, and I can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.31,0:15:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.43,0:15:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Dude, we've been looking all over for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.87,0:15:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're\Nstill down in the dumps
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.77,0:15:56.23,Default,,0,0,0,,about not getting to\Nduel against the Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.31,0:15:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let go, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.09,0:15:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.05,0:16:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,being on this boat has made me do a lot of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.35,0:16:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking about the last\Nfew years of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.25,0:16:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you, a lot's\Nchanged since I met the pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.21,0:16:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He taught me that even when\Nthe odds are against you,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.55,0:16:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,you have to keep fighting and\Nnever give up no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.97,0:16:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's someone whose\Nlife he changed even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.53,0:16:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Yugi's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.49,0:16:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why Yugi needs\Nto be the one to duel him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.51,0:16:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,To see if he's finally\Nready to be on his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.59,0:16:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, you're a lot\Nsmarter than you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.39,0:16:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.55,0:16:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's say this Pharaoh does exist, and
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.59,0:16:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,he's the reason yugi's\Nbeen winning duels all
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.79,0:16:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,these years then how on earth is a twerp
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.59,0:16:43.24,Default,,0,0,0,,like yugi gonna defeat\Nthe true king of games
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.65,0:17:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That was harder than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.47,0:17:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it safe to come out now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.37,0:17:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you chosen your cards?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.97,0:17:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yup, my deck's complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.63,0:17:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so is that why I haven't heard\Nfrom you in the past few hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.05,0:17:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.96,0:17:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I traveled to a distant corner of\Nyour mind to give you some privacy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.55,0:17:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.97,0:17:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The cards in my opponent's\Ndeck should be a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.27,0:17:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And just so you know, I don't plan on\Ngoing easy on you in tomorrow's duel. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.69,0:17:36.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, I've gotten to know your\Nstrategies pretty well. Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.73,0:17:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,when you share a mind with\Nsomeone for as long as we have,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.93,0:17:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,you tend to learn a thing or two\Nabout how the other one thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.87,0:17:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's time\Nfor you to pick your deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.67,0:17:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And don't worry, I promise I won't peek.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.35,0:18:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This is by far the toughest duel of my\Nlife, not just because the Pharaoh is
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.15,0:18:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,such a great duelist but because winning\Nthis duel means losing my closest friend
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,i feel as though every opponent i've ever\Nfaced was preparing me for this moment
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.23,0:18:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,the moment that will decide the fate of my
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.77,0:18:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,spirit if i win i remain\Nhere sealed within
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.39,0:18:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,the millennium puzzle but if i lose i'm
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.67,0:18:31.41,Default,,0,0,0,,free to enter the spirit\Nworld where i belong
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.15,0:18:37.09,Default,,0,0,0,,within that box lies yuki's deck chosen\Nfrom a collection that we created
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.17,0:18:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,together but built completely on his\Nown and now it is my turn to do the same
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.27,0:19:01.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It is now complete. I have succeeded\Nin building my strongest deck ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.43,0:19:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,and now the time has come to put it\Nto the test yugi it's time to duel
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.13,0:19:23.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Look who decided to roll out of bed
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.61,0:19:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.47,0:19:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I say we get this duel on the road
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.37,0:19:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.07,0:19:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
